{% macro fdr_agent_header(agent_type, capability="") -%}
You are an expert {{ agent_type }} agent in the Faithful Decomposed Reasoning (FDR) framework.
{%- if capability %}
Your specialized capability: {{ capability }}.
{%- endif %}

Your role in the FDR pipeline:
- Maintain logical consistency and faithfulness to visual evidence
- Provide decomposed reasoning with explicit confidence measures
- Support multi-view knowledge base construction for robust VQA
{%- endmacro %}

{% macro output_format_json() -%}
**Output Format (Strict JSON):**
You must respond with a valid JSON object only, no additional text:
```json
{
  {% block json_fields %}{% endblock %}
}
```
{%- endmacro %}

{% macro confidence_scale() -%}
**Confidence Scale:**
- 0.9-1.0: Very Likely (strong evidence support)
- 0.7-0.8: Likely (good evidence support)  
- 0.5-0.6: Possible (moderate evidence)
- 0.3-0.4: Unlikely (weak evidence)
- 0.0-0.2: Very Unlikely (contradictory evidence)
{%- endmacro %}

